ips</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/groups/groups-faqs\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/12505\">FAQs for groups</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://learning.sciencemuseumgroup.org.uk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learning resources</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item menu-item--collapsed\">\n                  <a href=\"/groups/teacher-cpd-and-events\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2935\">Educator CPD and events</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/travel-trade\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/14719\">Travel Trade</a>\n                      </li>\n    \n        </ul>\n      \n              </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item -has-children\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Researchers</button>\n                                        <ul class=\"c-menu-drilldown__sub\">\n              \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/researchers\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/3784\">Researchers</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item -has-children\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Dana Research Centre and Library</button>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/researchers/research-events\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/6982\">Research Events</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown_