ty-substitution=\"canonical\">book free general admission tickets here</a>. Additional 9-10am free general admission tickets now available for <a href=\"https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sciencemuseum.org.uk%2Fsee-and-do%2Fwelcome&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cweb.team%40ScienceMuseum.ac.uk%7C8635f41d5d16429963c308de07154e57%7Ce967bcc0c07041c89f7e806069f6330b%7C1%7C0%7C638955985260747068%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=uLja8KLtskr9%2B7vzOmDaZtQeO1FG3SYgBboiKOY7Nxk%3D&amp;reserved=0\">half term (Monday 27 October-Sunday 2 November 2025)</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n\n      \n      \n      </div>\n</div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"o-mobile-menu\">\n      <nav  id=\"block-menunavigation-science-mobile\" class=\"o-list c-menu-mobile\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\">\n        \n            <div class=\"c-menu-drilldown -mobile\">\n      <div class=\"c-menu-drilldown__container\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list c-menu-drilldown__root\">\n              \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item -has-children\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Visit</button>\n                                        <ul class=\"c-menu-drilldown__sub\">\n              \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/visit\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2746\">Visit</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/visit/food-and-drink\" title=\"Food and drink\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2674\">Food and drink</a>\n                      </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"/visit/accessibility\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2677\">Accessibility</a>\n                      </li>\n    \n        